      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="fb-different-content">
          <h2 class="fb-different-title">What Makes BrandStory Different as a Facebook Marketing Agency in Dubai</h2>
          <p class="fb-different-desc mb-4">A lot of agencies in Dubai can set up a Facebook campaign. Very few can build one that consistently lowers your cost per lead while increasing your return on ad spend month after month. Here is how BrandStory does it differently:</p>
          <h4 class="fb-different-sub-headline">We are accountable to business outcomes, not activity metrics</h4>
          <p class="fb-different-desc">Clicks, reach, and impressions are easy to generate. Qualified leads, sales, and revenue are what actually matter. Every campaign we run is structured around the business outcome your company actually needs - and our reporting reflects that, every single month.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Right Column: Interactive Cards -->
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="fb-different-cards-wrap">
          <!-- Card 1: Strategy -->
          <div class="fb-different-card purple-card mb-4">
            <h3 class="fb-different-card-title">Strategy Before a Single Ad Goes Live</h3>
            <p class="fb-different-card-desc">We refuse to launch campaigns without a documented strategy. Before we spend a dirham, we have defined your audiences, mapped your funnel, written your messaging angles, structured your campaign architecture, and agreed on the KPIs we will be measured against. Most agencies launch first and figure it out later. We do not.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- Card 2: Tracking -->
          <div class="fb-different-card dark-card">
            <h3 class="fb-different-card-title">Tracking Built as a Foundation, Not an Afterthought</h3>
            <p class="fb-different-card-desc">The number one reason Facebook campaigns underperform in Dubai is poor tracking setup - not bad targeting. We spend significant time ensuring your Pixel is correctly installed, your conversion events are firing accurately, and your data is giving Facebook's algorithm the clean signal it needs to optimize toward your best-fit customers. We fix tracking before we build campaigns, not after we wonder why results are weak.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
